### Create a session
POST http://localhost:8000/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_name": "Alice Nguyen",
  "title": "Binary search",
  "kind": "code",
  "submission": "def binary_search(arr, target):\n    lo, hi = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    while lo <= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            lo = mid + 1\n        else:\n            hi = mid - 1\n    return -1\n",
  "language": "python",
  "sample_id": "binary_search"
}

###

### Submit a turn (replace session_id)
POST http://localhost:8000/sessions/s_example/turn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "It returns -1 when the loop ends without finding the target.",
  "pasted": true
}

###

### Get Report (replace session_id)
GET http://localhost:8000/sessions/s_example/report

###

### Get Teacher Summary
GET http://localhost:8000/teacher/summary
